  "about.how1": "Each box is a word. Colors mark its parts: prefix, root, suffix, ending, postfix.",
  "about.how2": "Each line is one formation step. Its label shows what was added and what kind of word it produced.",
  "about.how3": "Levels come from teaching lists (SMARTool) or frequency lists (Kelly). A dashed badge means the level is estimated from word frequency.",
  "about.how4": "Some splits and stress marks are machine guesses. They are marked as uncertain where the model is not confident.",
